# MedScript OPD: Cursor & AI Developer Rules

Refer to and strictly enforce:
1. `AGENTS.md`
2. `security/SECURITY-PROTOCOLS.md`

All code generation and modifications MUST comply with:
- Zero-trust RBAC on all Server Actions (`requirePermission` / `isDoctor`)
- CWE-290 immunity (never trust user Host/IP headers)
- NIST SP 800-88 storage zeroization (`PRAGMA secure_delete = ON`)
- Anti-password spraying policies
- Strict CSP without 'unsafe-eval'
- Mandatory test passing (`npm test`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm run audit:ci`)
